WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.427
Introduce a claim, support it with reasons and credible examples, and close with a

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:06.173
purposeful conclusion.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:12.370
What does evidence do in persuasive writing? Answer: Supports a claim with facts or

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:12.751
examples.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:18.668
Write two paragraphs persuading your school to protect a reading area, citing real

00:00:18.668 --> 00:00:19.057
examples.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:22.320
Why it works: Evidence strengthens a claim.
